---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { fullAddress, site } from "../config/site";
---

<LegalLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How Ocho Glasgow handles personal information. Draft for review.">
  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>
    This website is run by [LEGAL BUSINESS NAME] trading as Ocho, {fullAddress}. Telephone {site.phone.display}.
    Email: [EMAIL]. [Company number / ICO registration number if applicable.]
  </p>

  <h2>What this website collects</h2>
  <p>
    This website itself does not ask you to create an account and does not run contact forms. It does not use
    analytics or advertising tracking at the time of writing. [Update if analytics are added.]
  </p>
  <p>Our hosting provider, Cloudflare, processes basic technical data (such as IP addresses) to deliver and protect the site.</p>

  <h2>Online ordering (Flipdish)</h2>
  <p>
    Online orders are taken through Flipdish. When you order, Flipdish processes your details (such as name, contact
    details, address and payment information) to handle your order. Please read Flipdish's own privacy policy.
    [Confirm the controller/processor relationship with Flipdish.]
  </p>

  <h2>Table bookings (Dojo)</h2>
  <p>
    Table bookings are handled through Dojo. When you book, Dojo processes the details you give it to manage your
    reservation. Please read Dojo's own privacy policy. [Confirm the controller/processor relationship with Dojo.]
  </p>

  <h2>Maps</h2>
  <p>
    Our "Open in maps" links take you to Google Maps. We do not embed maps on this website, so Google does not load
    anything until you click the link.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Under UK data protection law you can ask to see, correct or delete personal information we hold about you, and you
    can complain to the Information Commissioner's Office (ico.org.uk). Contact us using the details above.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>Last updated: [DATE].</p>
</LegalLayout>
